[{"title":"自君之出矣","author":"刘基","text":"自君之出矣，云鬓愁不绾。\n思君如辘轳，倏忽心百转。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8282,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"美人烧香词","author":"刘基","text":"翡翠钗梁云作叶，腻红深晕桃花颊。\n玉奴纤手捲虾须，绣罗袜小不胜扶。\n低头背人整裙带，神前独自深深拜。\n翠袖轻回香雾分，细语悠悠听不闻。\n门外游人空驻马，冥冥白日西山下。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8283,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"筑城词","author":"刘基","text":"君不见杭州无城贼直入，台州有城贼不入。\n重门击柝自古来，而况四郊多警急？\n愚民莫可与虑始，见说筑城俱不喜。\n一朝城成不可踰，挈家却向城中居。\n寄语筑城人：城高固自好，更须足食仍足兵，不然剑阁潼关且难保。\n独不念至元延祐年，天下无城亦不盗。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8284,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"买马词","author":"刘基","text":"驿官亭鼓鼕鼕打，驿使星驰买官马。\n府官奔走群吏趍，呵叱县官如使奴。\n一时立限限乡役，马价顿增无处觅。\n卖田买马来纳官，买时辛苦纳时难。\n县官定价府官减，骅骝也作驽骀看。\n归来拊膺向隅泣，门前索钱风火急。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8285,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"雨雪曲","author":"刘基","text":"北风吹尘沙，雨雪日夜深。\n三足之乌毛氄飞不远，白昼惨淡成幽阴。\n青天冥冥不可睹，水有罔象路有虎。\n平民避乱入山谷，编蓬作屋无环堵。\n回看故里尽荆榛，野乌争食声怒嗔。\n盗贼官军齐劫掠，去住无所容其身。\n呜呼，彼苍何日回春阳，北风雨雪断人肠！","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8286,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"苦寒行","author":"刘基","text":"去年苦寒犹身可，今年苦寒愁杀我。\n去年苦寒冻裂唇，犹有草茅堪蔽身。\n今年苦寒冻入髓，妻啼子哭空山里。\n空山日夜望官军，燕颔虎头闻不闻？","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8287,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"远客叹雨","author":"刘基","text":"远客暮年筋力寡，入门无家出无马。\n冷风一夜雨潇潇，平明道上泥没腰。\n灶下湿新不生火，敲冰取水指欲堕。\n仆夫怨怒呼不前，终日忍饥掩关坐。\n忧来伤心令发白，人生百身莫为客。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8288,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"久别离","author":"刘基","text":"久别离，别时小儿未解语。\n今日踉蹡庭下来，向人问爷泪如雨。\n儿知有爷未曾识，爷有母在愁何极。\n明庭不奏采薇诗，久别离，当语谁？","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8289,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"苦热行 其一","author":"刘基","text":"南风吹云不成泽，朝霞暮霞山谷赤。\n赤松羽人潜大荒，火府朱陵气相射。\n蜚廉翅跕不能奋，蓱号眼枯口流液，远客魂销畏絺绤。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8290,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"苦热行 其二","author":"刘基","text":"忆昔伏波南伐时，穿岸为宫避炎气。\n青草茫茫起瘴烟，吹虫含沙总堪畏。\n人生惜死非男儿，但有马革可裹尸，武陵之曲何伤悲！","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8291,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"梁甫吟 送郑希道入京","author":"刘基","text":"老翁生长平原里，但见平原路如砥。\n谓言路平无崄巇，车轮不摧马如飞。\n今日驱车上梁甫，回头却忆平原路。\n梁甫吟，愁我心。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8292,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"望远行 俟后舟不至作","author":"刘基","text":"望远行，日日望来肠欲断，数遍南风下水船。\n愁中白日偏难晚，顺风顺水不易得，欲去又愁来者远。\n望远行，一望令人白发生。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8293,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"女儿割股词 为徐勉之作","author":"刘基","text":"女儿少小幽闺里，深掩重帘学针指。\n施朱傅粉有母怜，一朝无母将焉恃？\n青灯背壁月当户，峘山之禽夜啼苦。\n丹元诉天天为愁，泪洒长河作飞雨。\n嗟儿与母同为身，母子分离何苦辛？\n抽刀割股股不血，一念自感皇穹仁。\n吾闻孝慈出天性，人心至诚天必听。\n儿股有肉母所育，母生儿死儿亦足。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8294,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"蛮中歌 其一","author":"刘基","text":"小儿负薪早巳归，大身螺，□不回。\n海上樯竿齐入浦，山头云起飓风来。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8295,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"蛮中歌 其二","author":"刘基","text":"祝融庙前稻齐椰，子如瓠，压枝低。\n乌鸦乱叫祭鬼罢，桄榔树里鹧鸪啼。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8296,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"闺词 其二","author":"刘基","text":"昨夜三更梦，分明见所思。\n觉来惊枕席，心迹两相疑。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8297,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"闺词 其三","author":"刘基","text":"塞雁南还北，江潮西复东。\n佳人不可见，霜雪万山空。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8298,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"闺词 其五","author":"刘基","text":"小小雍渠鸟，双双入画楼。\n楼中人怨别，爱尔不知愁。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8299,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"闺词 其六","author":"刘基","text":"欲寄音书去，书成乏便邮。\n持书上楼望，泪洒鹔鹴裘。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8300,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"乌啼曲","author":"刘基","text":"可怪乌鸦鸟，鸣声不喜人。\n如何好彊聒，故博主人嗔？","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8301,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"五杂俎 其一","author":"刘基","text":"五杂俎，原上翮。\n往复还，小贩客，不得巳，滹沱麦。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8302,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"五杂俎 其二","author":"刘基","text":"五杂俎，百衲衣。\n往复还，燕双飞，不得巳，赋式微。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8303,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"五杂俎 其三","author":"刘基","text":"五杂俎，市卖果。\n往复还，邮传马，不得巳，死垓下。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8304,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"春江曲","author":"刘基","text":"江上风帆日日归，独自狂夫音信稀。\n无因化作鵁鶄鸟，随著郎船到处飞。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8305,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"公子行","author":"刘基","text":"玉勒金鞍照地光，驼裘珠帽绣文章。\n平明上马归来醉，他日清朝作栋梁。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8306,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"黄鹄曲","author":"刘基","text":"黄鹄双飞中路分，关山风雪陇头云。\n云深雪暗知何处，哀叫声声天上闻。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8307,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"吴歌 其二","author":"刘基","text":"承郎顾盼感郎怜，准拟欢娱到百年。\n明月比心花比面，花容美满月团圆。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8308,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"吴歌 其三","author":"刘基","text":"便道逢春花合开，谁知秾艳有人猜。\n山鸡不入家鸡侣，野果难同园果栽。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8309,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"采莲歌 其一","author":"刘基","text":"十三女儿白似脂，向人学得做娇痴。\n折得白莲头上插，苧罗山下赛西施。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8310,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"采莲歌 其二","author":"刘基","text":"十五女儿花正开，随群逐伴采花回。\n浓妆比似花娇艳，引得黄蜂队队来。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8311,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"采莲歌 其四","author":"刘基","text":"芍药争春衒彩霞，芙蓉秋尽却荣华。\n有色有香兼有实，百花都不似莲花。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8312,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"采莲歌 其五","author":"刘基","text":"女伴相随出芰荷，并船比较采莲多。\n抬头忽见游人过，棹入菰蒲水拍波。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8313,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"采莲歌 其六","author":"刘基","text":"晚凉风定却回船，望见新月在天边。\n放下荷花深深拜，翻身忙整翠花钿。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8314,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其一","author":"刘基","text":"人间日月去如梭，快活无多辛苦多。\n欲识江南古来意，请君听唱竹枝歌。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8315,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其三","author":"刘基","text":"阳台云雨漫荒唐，巫峡啼猿枉断肠。\n莫向苍梧山下去，九疑愁色满潇湘。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8316,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其四","author":"刘基","text":"潇湘江水接天河，第一伤心是汨罗。\n斑竹冈头兰蕙死，黄茅垄上艾蒿多。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8317,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其六","author":"刘基","text":"若要开花须护持，花枝怕雨怕风吹。\n抽条结蕊千辛苦，糁土埋苔一霎时。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8318,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其七","author":"刘基","text":"弯弯月子似帘钩，挂在梧桐树上头。\n月里姮娥知何处，人间离别未为愁。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8319,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其八","author":"刘基","text":"昨夜星光照湿泥，五更依旧雨凄凄。\n懊恼人心难测度，说道东方却在西。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8320,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其九","author":"刘基","text":"杜鹃花开不著忙，石莲花落却恓惶。\n垆头酒尽休悬望，裁衣无尺莫思量。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8321,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其十","author":"刘基","text":"莫见乾藤道是香，莫见白石道是羊。\n布帘卖酒齐誇好，甜辣须还到口尝。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8322,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其十二","author":"刘基","text":"望帝无端化羽毛，无朝无暮口嘈嘈。\n见说天高三万物，吻乾舌出也徒劳。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8323,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"江南曲 其三","author":"刘基","text":"洞庭湖色碧于蓝，潇湘日融花欲酣。\n黄鹤楼中留醉客，懒人天气是江南。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8324,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"江南曲 其六","author":"刘基","text":"无情白日去如梭，有限青春可柰何。\n江北风沙人住少，江南粳稻雁来多。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8325,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"前溪曲","author":"刘基","text":"前溪送别溪水满，石楠花落蒲芽短。\n春风无情看复秋，莫学落花随水流。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8326,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"长门怨","author":"刘基","text":"不学周南咏小星，空悲玉殿锁娉婷。\n黄金漫买相如赋，犹胜无辜送掖庭。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8327,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"山鹧鸪 其一","author":"刘基","text":"女儿未始会穿针，将去高丽学语音。\n教得新番鹧鸪曲，一声准拟直千金。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8328,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"山鹧鸪 其二","author":"刘基","text":"鹦鹉能言百鸟惊，鹧鸪叫噪阻人行。\n珊瑚软语呈娇媚，不似班鸠得拙名。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8329,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"山鹧鸪 其三","author":"刘基","text":"溪深不比海子深，一物从来有一心。\n野凫赶鱼溪上去，鹧鸪飞过野凫沉。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8330,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"浣纱女 其一","author":"刘基","text":"袅袅腰肢王一围，妒红娇绿淡春晖。\n莫教名字传宫掖，终遣诗人剌绿衣。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8331,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"浣纱女 其二","author":"刘基","text":"卧薪终夜泣孤臣，落月飞霜几度春。\n能使姑苏聚麋鹿，谁知却是浣纱人。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8332,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"双带子 其一","author":"刘基","text":"嫁时双带绣骐驎，翠叶金花色色新。\n宁教尘匣蒙蛛网，不肯将来别赠人。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8333,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"双带子 其二","author":"刘基","text":"结得同心欲寄郎，还将双带剌鸳央。\n殷勤祝付西归燕，一纸书缄泪两行。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8334,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"双带子 其三","author":"刘基","text":"合欢双带绣蜻蜓，一度看来一泪零。\n雪里芭蕉心长在，春来不改旧时青。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8335,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"双带子 其四","author":"刘基","text":"莫言长夜便无明，莫道离鸾不合并。\n天上星辰能化石，黄河千岁也还清。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8336,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"鸡鸣曲 其一","author":"刘基","text":"霜飞月落天峥嵘，咿咿喔喔邻鸡鸣。\n龙蛇杂遝寰海沸，谁知此声非恶声？","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8337,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"鸡鸣曲 其二","author":"刘基","text":"莫厌晨鸡相应啼，中原千里绝晨鸡。\n一匡自是无伯仲，坐谈不用誇曾西。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8338,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"塞姑 其一","author":"刘基","text":"苔没行踪草没堤，满帘红日一莺啼。\n天涯那得真消息，不敢逢人问碛西。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8339,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"塞姑 其二","author":"刘基","text":"肠断龙沙信不通，梦中长恒醒时空。\n夜来忽得揄关报，知忆传闻是梦中。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8340,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"塞姑 其三","author":"刘基","text":"满箧衣裳手自裁，寄君亲付与郎开。\n锦衾角枕期窀穸，遮莫无人莫寄回。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8341,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"春曲 其一","author":"刘基","text":"春天不雨亦不晴，杨花飘尽池萍生。\n庭鸟雏成巢燕瞑，惟有杜鹃啼到明。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8342,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"春曲 其二","author":"刘基","text":"春晴野烟生绿塘，春游綵女铅华光。\n碧云日暮去何处，红荇白蘋他自香。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8343,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其二","author":"刘基","text":"汉将营中万树春，朱旗晓色动星辰。\n可怜烟雨章台路，翠缕斜萦走马尘。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8344,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其三","author":"刘基","text":"杨叶凄凄隐画楼，杨枝袅袅弄轻柔。\n鸣鸠叫罢黄莺语，肯信年华有素秋。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8345,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其四","author":"刘基","text":"忆昔春风白下亭，桃红李白柳青青。\n繁华一梦今何在，露叶依稀似泪零。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8346,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其五","author":"刘基","text":"长千桥边杨柳枝，千条万缕郁金丝。\n人来人去争攀折，无复青青映酒旗。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8347,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其六","author":"刘基","text":"淮水春晴碧簟纹，杨花杨叶总成云。\n锦帆零落美人画，枝上流莺谁独闻。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8348,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其七","author":"刘基","text":"二月垂杨绿叶齐，无朝无暮子规啼。\n飞花衮衮向东去，却被东风吹向西。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8349,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其八","author":"刘基","text":"枝上秾花吹渐稀，楼前杨柳正依依。\n春风解释佳人恨，故卷繁阴放燕归。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8350,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其九","author":"刘基","text":"长江春水去悠悠，乱絮轻花取次休。\n落日高楼怨横笛，寒鸦飞尽暮蝉愁。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8351,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"宫怨 其一","author":"刘基","text":"沉沉烟雨掩孤闱，可怪东风到得迟。\n今日晴明上楼望，不知花谢巳多时。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8352,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"女儿子","author":"刘基","text":"女儿二六月上弦，娇羞长在阿婆边。\n阿婆惜爱女儿子，女儿只愁阿婆死。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":8353,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}}]